  (text "Button or PC4 turns Q2 on, which grounds R1 and lets the soft start turn Q1 on. Q2 off: Q5 turns Q4 on, snapping Q1 off. JP2 bridged = always on, as before. Off leaves about 20 uA of leakage" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17 298 0)
